<title>USA: Silicon Graphics Inc Q1 Sept 30 loss.</title>
<headline>Silicon Graphics Inc Q1 Sept 30 loss.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.13	  profit  $0.33</p>
<p> Net loss	  21,732	 profit  58,357</p>
<p> Revs		765,602		  595,279</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  172,974		  179,236</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  September 30, 1996 amounts reflect the acquisition of Cray Research. Latest quarter includes special charges of $22 million, some of which relates to the merger with Cray Research. Q3 shr loss is after preferred stock dividends of $131,000.</p>
